{"id":1010104,"chapter_id":1010104,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"MBCC临时任务记录\n时间：112年██月██日\n地点：锈河上游高危带。","style":14,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"content":"任务目标：寻找薇拉·谢尔德的遗体。","style":14,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"speaker":"警卫","content":"侦测到死役生命反应，数量：4，距离：10米……局长！","voice":["vo_trial_10104_1_1"],"voice_bank":"vo_dimeng_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"options":["全员警戒！"],"style":6,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104004,"trial_step":4,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"全员警戒！","goto":5}]},{"step":5,"content":"几道黑影从废墟中探出，冲了过来。","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"content":"砰——","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104006,"trial_step":6},{"step":7,"content":"最先扑过来的死役在半空中被迪蒙扼住喉管，重重掼向地面。庞大的死役只是抽搐了几下，便不再动弹。","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104007,"trial_step":7},{"step":8,"content":"找好掩体，交替射击！","style":2,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104008,"trial_step":8},{"step":9,"content":"火力覆盖之下，两只死役寸步难进，很快被射成了筛子。","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104009,"trial_step":9},{"step":10,"content":"然而，最后一只死役不知何时绕过了正面的警卫，朝你扑了过来。","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104010,"trial_step":10},{"step":11,"speaker":"迪蒙","content":"！","voice":["vo_trial_10104_1_2"],"voice_bank":"vo_dimeng_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104011,"trial_step":11},{"step":12,"content":"迪蒙最先反应过来，举着盾牌猛地将它撞向最近的水泥柱。","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104012,"trial_step":12},{"step":13,"content":"锈河无人区的建筑年久失修，根本无法承受这样的撞击。","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104013,"trial_step":13},{"step":14,"content":"六层高的烂尾楼整个坍塌下来。","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104014,"trial_step":14},{"step":15,"speaker":"警卫","content":"局长……滋滋……听得到吗？局长！请回答！","voice":["vo_trial_10104_1_3"],"voice_bank":"vo_dimeng_trial","style":11,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104015,"trial_step":15},{"step":16,"options":["回应警卫"],"style":6,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104016,"trial_step":16,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"回应警卫","goto":17}]},{"step":17,"content":"听得到，我没事。","style":2,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104017,"trial_step":17},{"step":18,"content":"迪蒙掸了掸身上的碎石土灰，站起身，一言不发地看向你。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104018,"trial_step":18},{"step":19,"content":"……迪蒙也没事。","style":2,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104019,"trial_step":19},{"step":20,"speaker":"警卫","content":"我们最快会在……二十分钟内达到您所在的位置……请待在原地……不要移动……","voice":["vo_trial_10104_1_4"],"voice_bank":"vo_dimeng_trial","style":11,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104020,"trial_step":20},{"step":21,"speaker":"迪蒙","content":"刚才的动静会惊扰这片区域所有死役……","voice":["vo_trial_10104_1_5"],"voice_bank":"vo_dimeng_trial","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104021,"trial_step":21},{"step":22,"content":"迪蒙没有继续说下去，但是你知道他的意思。待在原地，与等死无异。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104022,"trial_step":22},{"step":23,"content":"我们会保持移动，有他在，暂时不会有太大的危险。","style":2,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104023,"trial_step":23},{"step":24,"speaker":"警卫","content":"可是……","voice":["vo_trial_10104_1_80"],"voice_bank":"vo_dimeng_trial","style":11,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104024,"trial_step":24},{"step":25,"content":"你知道他想说什么，你身边的这个人才是最大的“危险”。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104025,"trial_step":25},{"step":26,"content":"事到如今，没有别的选择了。","style":2,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104026,"trial_step":26},{"step":27,"content":"我先去目的地，你们返回接应点等我。","style":2,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104027,"trial_step":27},{"step":28,"speaker":"警卫","content":"……明白。","voice":["vo_trial_10104_1_6"],"voice_bank":"vo_dimeng_trial","style":11,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104028,"trial_step":28},{"step":29,"content":"你关闭了无线电耳麦，朝着迪蒙招手。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104029,"trial_step":29},{"step":30,"content":"他们似乎还不太信任你。","style":2,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104030,"trial_step":30},{"step":31,"speaker":"迪蒙","content":"他们是对的。","voice":["vo_trial_10104_1_7"],"voice_bank":"vo_dimeng_trial","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104031,"trial_step":31},{"step":32,"content":"带有调侃性质的对话没能缓和沉重的气氛。但至少有迪蒙保护，你的生存几率能大大提高。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104032,"trial_step":32},{"step":33,"content":"审判之后，他变得愈发消瘦和阴沉。可不管怎么说，眼前这个男人也曾是FAC下属特遣队的队长，最擅长应对这种局面的人。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104033,"trial_step":33},{"step":34,"content":"好了，走吧。我们还有任务要完成。","style":2,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104034,"trial_step":34},{"step":35,"content":"这次，迪蒙没有否认。他举起盾牌，走到了你的身前。因为这个任务，正是他亲自申请的。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104035,"trial_step":35},{"step":36,"content":"任务的目标只有一个——寻找迪蒙的义妹、薇拉·谢尔德的遗体。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104036,"trial_step":36},{"step":37,"content":"推开朽死的铁门，你们进入了一间疗养院。","style":3,"background":106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104037,"trial_step":37},{"step":38,"content":"浓烈的臭味混杂着霉味扑面而来，叫人睁不开眼。门内的走廊上，躺着十几具遗体。","style":3,"background":106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104038,"trial_step":38},{"step":39,"content":"有死役，也有人类。","style":3,"background":106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104039,"trial_step":39},{"step":40,"speaker":"迪蒙","content":"就是这里。","voice":["vo_trial_10104_1_8"],"voice_bank":"vo_dimeng_trial","style":1,"background":106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104040,"trial_step":40},{"step":41,"content":"两个月前，第九机关的人曾经来过这里。他们找到了自己想要的东西。","style":3,"background":106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104041,"trial_step":41},{"step":42,"content":"不过，也有些人死在了这里。","style":3,"background":106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104042,"trial_step":42},{"step":43,"content":"第九机关的人让审判官“指认尸体”的时候，我还以为……","style":2,"background":106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104043,"trial_step":43},{"step":44,"content":"他们该带上薇拉的。","style":2,"background":106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104044,"trial_step":44},{"step":45,"speaker":"迪蒙","content":"他们没这个义务。","voice":["vo_trial_10104_1_9"],"voice_bank":"vo_dimeng_trial","style":1,"background":106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104045,"trial_step":45},{"step":46,"content":"迪蒙蹲下身，检验了地上的遗体。","style":3,"background":106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104046,"trial_step":46},{"step":47,"speaker":"迪蒙","content":"没有死役化的风险……","voice":["vo_trial_10104_1_10"],"voice_bank":"vo_dimeng_trial","style":1,"background":106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104047,"trial_step":47},{"step":48,"content":"他将自己的披风取下，盖在了上面。","style":3,"background":106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104048,"trial_step":48},{"step":49,"content":"电梯早已不堪用，你们沿着楼梯一路向上，终于来到指定的房间门前。","style":3,"background":106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104049,"trial_step":49},{"step":50,"content":"门前的灰尘比其他地方更薄，整条走廊遍布着脚印，这个房间门前的尤其集中。","style":3,"background":106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104050,"trial_step":50},{"step":51,"content":"你知道，你们到地方了。","style":3,"background":106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104051,"trial_step":51},{"step":52,"speaker":"迪蒙","content":"……","voice":["vo_trial_10104_1_11"],"voice_bank":"vo_dimeng_trial","style":1,"background":106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104052,"trial_step":52},{"step":53,"content":"迪蒙握住了门把手。你第一次在他脸上看到犹豫和退缩。","style":3,"background":106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104053,"trial_step":53},{"step":54,"content":"需要我在门外等你一会儿么？","style":2,"background":106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104054,"trial_step":54},{"step":55,"content":"迪蒙摇了摇头，拧开了门把手。","style":3,"background":106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104055,"trial_step":55},{"step":56,"content":"门后的房间不过八平米大小。窗边一张灰色的床上，长眠的少女蜷缩在那里。","style":3,"background":1034,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104056,"trial_step":56},{"step":57,"speaker":"迪蒙","content":"薇拉……","voice":["vo_trial_10104_1_12"],"voice_bank":"vo_dimeng_trial","style":1,"background":1034,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104057,"trial_step":57},{"step":58,"content":"他有些踉跄地走过去，跪坐在床前，动作无比轻柔，生怕吵醒沉睡的少女。","style":3,"background":1034,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104058,"trial_step":58},{"step":59,"speaker":"迪蒙","content":"我……","voice":["vo_trial_10104_1_13"],"voice_bank":"vo_dimeng_trial","style":1,"background":1034,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104059,"trial_step":59},{"step":60,"content":"迪蒙想要说些什么，却又哽在嘴里。他伏在床边，阳光从废弃建筑的缝隙中漏下来，灰尘在细碎的光束间飞行。","style":3,"background":1034,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104060,"trial_step":60},{"step":61,"content":"时间一分一秒地过去，迪蒙一言不发。可瘆人的死役怪叫声却越来越近，你不得不出声提醒。","style":3,"background":1034,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104061,"trial_step":61},{"step":62,"content":"我们该走了……","style":2,"background":1034,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104062,"trial_step":62},{"step":63,"content":"迪蒙转过头，看了你一眼。","style":3,"background":1034,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104063,"trial_step":63},{"step":64,"speaker":"迪蒙","content":"嗯……","voice":["vo_trial_10104_1_14"],"voice_bank":"vo_dimeng_trial","style":1,"background":1034,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104064,"trial_step":64},{"step":65,"speaker":"迪蒙","content":"我知道。","voice":["vo_trial_10104_1_15"],"voice_bank":"vo_dimeng_trial","style":1,"background":1034,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104065,"trial_step":65},{"step":66,"content":"他将遗骨一件件放入背包。一并带走的，还有薇拉枕边那蒙着厚厚灰尘的笔记本。","style":3,"background":1034,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104066,"trial_step":66},{"step":67,"content":"做完这一切后，他站起身，朝你走来。","style":3,"background":1034,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104067,"trial_step":67},{"step":68,"speaker":"迪蒙","content":"抱歉，让你久等。","voice":["vo_trial_10104_1_16"],"voice_bank":"vo_dimeng_trial","style":1,"background":1034,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104068,"trial_step":68},{"step":69,"options":["没关系，我理解。"],"style":6,"background":1034,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104069,"trial_step":69,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"没关系，我理解。","goto":70}]},{"step":70,"content":"迪蒙十分勉强地笑了笑，看上去更加憔悴了。深陷的眼窝里，除了疲惫与悲哀，再无别的颜色。","style":3,"background":1034,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104070,"trial_step":70},{"step":71,"content":"四周，死役的嚎叫变得越来越密集。","style":3,"background":1034,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104071,"trial_step":71},{"step":72,"speaker":"迪蒙","content":"走吧。","voice":["vo_trial_10104_1_17"],"voice_bank":"vo_dimeng_trial","style":1,"background":1034,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104072,"trial_step":72},{"step":73,"content":"你和迪蒙在坍塌的废墟和碎石间行走了很久。死役出现的频率却越来越高。","style":3,"background":1013,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104073,"trial_step":73},{"step":74,"content":"好在，目的地已经很近了，你已经能看到辛迪加市区的灯光。","style":3,"background":1013,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104074,"trial_step":74},{"step":75,"speaker":"迪蒙","content":"小心背后！","voice":["vo_trial_10104_1_18"],"voice_bank":"vo_dimeng_trial","style":1,"background":1013,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104075,"trial_step":75},{"step":76,"content":"琳达张口结舌如遭雷劈。","style":3,"background":1013,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104076,"trial_step":76},{"step":77,"content":"迪蒙侧身将背后的死役摁倒。在地面与盾牌的双重挤压下，狰狞的怪物顷刻间便停止了反抗。","style":3,"background":1013,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104077,"trial_step":77},{"step":78,"content":"死役头上锋利的骨片却也划开了他的手，留下伤口。","style":3,"background":1013,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104078,"trial_step":78},{"step":79,"content":"这一波……暂时解决完了。多亏了你，迪蒙。","style":2,"background":1013,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104079,"trial_step":79},{"step":80,"content":"与你的如释重负相反，迪蒙若无其事地处理完手中的伤口，声音里却没有战斗结束和逃出生天的喜悦。","style":3,"background":1013,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104080,"trial_step":80},{"step":81,"speaker":"迪蒙","content":"情况……很不妙。","voice":["vo_trial_10104_1_19"],"voice_bank":"vo_dimeng_trial","style":1,"background":1013,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104081,"trial_step":81},{"step":82,"content":"你在担心什么？","options":["你在担心什么？"],"style":6,"background":1013,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104082,"trial_step":82,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"你在担心什么？","goto":83}]},{"step":83,"content":"警卫已经抵达接应点。我们距离无人区的边界很近了……","style":2,"background":1013,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104083,"trial_step":83},{"step":84,"content":"凭借你的力量，我们一定可以撤离，你在担心什么？","style":2,"background":1013,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104084,"trial_step":84},{"step":85,"content":"迪蒙抬头看了一眼天空。层层叠叠的云霾遮住了星星，又被城市的灯光染成令人不安的灰黄色。","style":3,"background":1013,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104085,"trial_step":85},{"step":86,"speaker":"迪蒙","content":"是，很近……","voice":["vo_trial_10104_1_20"],"voice_bank":"vo_dimeng_trial","style":1,"background":1013,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104086,"trial_step":86},{"step":87,"speaker":"迪蒙","content":"但这就是最坏的状况。","voice":["vo_trial_10104_1_21"],"voice_bank":"vo_dimeng_trial","style":1,"background":1013,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104087,"trial_step":87},{"step":88,"content":"看着不远处辛迪加居民区的灯光，你终于意识到迪蒙在说什么。","style":3,"background":1013,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104088,"trial_step":88},{"step":89,"content":"我们甩不脱死役，它们很可能会跟着我们离开无人区……","style":2,"background":1013,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104089,"trial_step":89},{"step":90,"speaker":"迪蒙","content":"会有很多人牺牲。","voice":["vo_trial_10104_1_22"],"voice_bank":"vo_dimeng_trial","style":1,"background":1013,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104090,"trial_step":90},{"step":91,"content":"我立刻通知FAC，让他们派人！","style":2,"background":1013,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104091,"trial_step":91},{"step":92,"speaker":"迪蒙","content":"来不及了。","voice":["vo_trial_10104_1_23"],"voice_bank":"vo_dimeng_trial","style":1,"background":1013,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104092,"trial_step":92},{"step":93,"speaker":"迪蒙","content":"这里距离最近的居民区多远？","voice":["vo_trial_10104_1_24"],"voice_bank":"vo_dimeng_trial","style":1,"background":1013,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104093,"trial_step":93},{"step":94,"content":"你下意识看了眼卫星地图。","style":3,"background":1013,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104094,"trial_step":94},{"step":95,"content":"2.5公里……","style":2,"background":1013,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104095,"trial_step":95},{"step":96,"content":"如此短的距离，等FAC赶到，街区恐怕早已化作炼狱。","style":3,"background":1013,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104096,"trial_step":96},{"step":97,"speaker":"迪蒙","content":"他们赶不过来的。","voice":["vo_trial_10104_1_25"],"voice_bank":"vo_dimeng_trial","style":1,"background":1013,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104097,"trial_step":97},{"step":98,"content":"迪蒙默默卸下背包，将里面的笔记本取出，然后把包交到你的手中。","style":3,"background":1013,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104098,"trial_step":98},{"step":99,"options":["你要干什么？！"],"style":6,"background":1013,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104099,"trial_step":99,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"你要干什么？！","goto":100}]},{"step":100,"speaker":"迪蒙","content":"替我安葬薇拉。","voice":["vo_trial_10104_1_26"],"voice_bank":"vo_dimeng_trial","style":1,"background":1013,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104100,"trial_step":100},{"step":101,"content":"他将盾牌立在地上，抽出腰间的匕首。","style":3,"background":1013,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104101,"trial_step":101},{"step":102,"content":"你疯了？！","style":2,"background":1013,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104102,"trial_step":102},{"step":103,"speaker":"迪蒙","content":"我会想办法拖住死役的推进。","voice":["vo_trial_10104_1_27"],"voice_bank":"vo_dimeng_trial","style":1,"background":1013,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104103,"trial_step":103},{"step":104,"speaker":"迪蒙","content":"你去找管理局的警卫，疏散周边的民众。等FAC的人到了，再清理这里。","voice":["vo_trial_10104_1_28"],"voice_bank":"vo_dimeng_trial","style":1,"background":1013,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104104,"trial_step":104},{"step":105,"content":"迪蒙抬头看了看周围的废墟。","style":3,"background":1013,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104105,"trial_step":105},{"step":106,"speaker":"迪蒙","content":"辛迪加已经失去了太多，得有人守住剩下那点东西。","voice":["vo_trial_10104_1_29"],"voice_bank":"vo_dimeng_trial","style":1,"background":1013,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104106,"trial_step":106},{"step":107,"content":"你会死的……","style":2,"background":1013,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104107,"trial_step":107},{"step":108,"speaker":"迪蒙","content":"这件事因我的私欲而起，我没理由逃避。","voice":["vo_trial_10104_1_30"],"voice_bank":"vo_dimeng_trial","style":1,"background":1013,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104108,"trial_step":108},{"step":109,"content":"他的语气里没有留恋，只有解脱。","style":3,"background":1013,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104109,"trial_step":109},{"step":110,"speaker":"迪蒙","content":"我这种人，死在这里反倒更轻松。","voice":["vo_trial_10104_1_31"],"voice_bank":"vo_dimeng_trial","style":1,"background":1013,"log_type":1,"src_id":110104110,"tria